bm25_rank": 12, "rrf": 0.03002, "selected": false}, {"text": "Launched on December 25, 2021, it is considered the successor to the Hubble Space Telescope. This controversy was reported in the press. The scientists who prop", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.537, "bm25": 12.82, "dense_rank": 13, "bm25_rank": 2, "rrf": 0.02983, "selected": false}, {"text": "The assembly was completed in California in 2015. It was integrated with the rest of the space telescope, leading to its 2021 launch. The spacecraft bus can rot", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.634, "bm25": 6.43, "dense_rank": 5, "bm25_rank": 14, "rrf": 0.0289, "selected": false}], "selected": 3, "echo_filtered": 0, "kept": 3}, "t": 9.116}
